<title>USA: Central Costanera names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Central Costanera names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina-based Central Costanera SA said on Friday it has named Juan Verbitsky as chief financial officer, effective October 14, 1996.</p>
<p>Verbitsky, who joins the company from  Edesur, replaces Bernardo Hopital, Central Costanera said.</p>
<p>Hopital left the company for another post at a Perez Companc SA subsidiary, said Central Costanera, a producer of thermoelectric power.</p>
</text>
